---
/**
 * Editorial, type-led hero — no hero image (keeps it fast + serious, in the
 * postquantum.com register). All copy is real, no placeholders.
 */
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow">Post-quantum &amp; compliance readiness</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">
      Your encryption has an <span class="hero__em">expiry date</span>.
      We help you find where it's hiding.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead hero__lead">
      RSA and elliptic-curve keys protect almost everything you store, and a big enough
      quantum computer breaks both. NIST finalized the replacements in August&nbsp;2024. We find
      where that aging cryptography still lives in your stack — TLS, PKI, code signing, HSMs,
      vendors — and give you a migration order you can actually sequence. The ISO&nbsp;27001 and
      ISO&nbsp;42001 work around it, too. We don't resell products, so there's nothing to upsell.
    </p>
    <div class="wrap-btns hero__btns">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Book a PQC Assessment</a>
      <a href="#insights" class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg">Read the insights</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 120% at 88% -15%, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 46%);
  }
  .hero__inner { padding-block: clamp(56px, 12vw, 128px); max-width: 60rem; }
  .hero__eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--sp-5); }
  .hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.2vw, 4.1rem);
    letter-spacing: -.025em;
    max-width: 20ch;
  }
  .hero__em {
    color: var(--accent-2);
    /* editorial underline that scales with the type */
    box-shadow: inset 0 -.14em 0 color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent);
  }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .hero__em { color: var(--accent); }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root:not([data-theme="light"]) .hero__em { color: var(--accent); } }
  .hero__lead { margin-top: var(--sp-5); max-width: 58ch; }
  .hero__btns { margin-top: var(--sp-6); }
</style>
